[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3197.19, "timestamp": "00:53:17", "text": "他们会用其他方式杀了你。他是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3199.829, "timestamp": "00:53:19", "text": "就在我眼前。多少次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3202.15, "timestamp": "00:53:22", "text": "我现在是不是已经死了？我的意思是，我就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3204.71, "timestamp": "00:53:24", "text": "十分钟后，重复三次。应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3207.91, "timestamp": "00:53:27", "text": "我把他从你身边带走？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3210.069, "timestamp": "00:53:30", "text": "不，这是个很棒的游戏开局方式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3211.75, "timestamp": "00:53:31", "text": "你知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3213.99, "timestamp": "00:53:33", "text": "它还在那里。它不会消失。哦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3217.67, "timestamp": "00:53:37", "text": "哦。哦。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3220.549, "timestamp": "00:53:40", "text": "对我来说，这太黑暗了。是的。这不是为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3223.589, "timestamp": "00:53:43", "text": "每个人。你是什​​么意思？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3227.75, "timestamp": "00:53:47", "text": "哦，欢迎来到“我觉得它不见了”的页面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3229.109, "timestamp": "00:53:49", "text": "好的，没问题了。我们很好。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3231.589, "timestamp": "00:53:51", "text": "好的。是的，它没了。他们现在可以走了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3234.549, "timestamp": "00:53:54", "text": "往南走，兄弟。嗯，我想也许"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3238.589, "timestamp": "00:53:58", "text": "就像个笑话。是的，他只是"}]